[465.813938, "o", "ok    config          /etc/boxrunner/config.toml, box box-1, 2 classes\r\nok    docker          Docker 29.1.3, API 1.47\r\nok    cgroup v2       cgroup version 2\r\nok    cgroup driver   systemd (boxrunner needs systemd)\r\nok    disk            23.0 GB free on /var/lib/docker, floor 10.0 GB \r\nok    firewall rules  in place for IPv4 and IPv6\r\nok    idle slice      container runs in /boxrunner_idle.slice, cpu.idle 1 \r\nok    host            the host at 172.18.0.1 is unreachable from jobs\r\nok    private         the private network's gateway is unreachable from jobs\r\nok    metadata        169.254.169.254 is unreachable from jobs\r\nok    github          github.com:443 from a job container (exit 0)\r\nok    clock           5s off github.com's clock\r\n"]
